    "detailed_description": "<u><strong>Enhance your Windows experience with Containers</strong></u><br><br>Containers allows the storage of your files and folders in boxes called <strong>\u201cContainer\u201d</strong>, these boxes can be accessed at any time on your desktop or called thanks to built-in shortcuts or with the help of the <strong>\u201cContainers Tab\u201d</strong> menu.<br><br><strong><u>Containers</u></strong><br>Containers are sticked to your desktop when you don't use them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/c9991a7e066b24a3161cd8cf2a674013.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Mirror Containers</u></strong><br>\u201cMirror\u201d Containers are representations of files and folders in a selected folder on your computer.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/684741bb47e6592c577a4f97913da07e.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Container Customization</u></strong><br>Containers can have different colored backgrounds or a background with an image.<br>You can also set the transparency method of your Containers.<br><br>If you are on Windows 11 you can also choose between Containers with rounded or squared edges.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Containers Tab Menu</u></strong><br>The Containers Tab menu allows you to call the Container of your choice without leaving the application in the foreground, it works similarly to the Alt-Tab menu in Windows.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/4e401c4bc6496fa6a7efc7f617df167c.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Closing Containers</u></strong><br>Containers can be independently closed manually or automatically to save space.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/13cf6c9c2cd969444dac2a94756a1424.webp?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Sorting Containers content</u></strong><br>You can independently sort the contents of your Containers according to your choice.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/0b3480c4faaaeced62eb95b8f64e5054.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Container content size</u></strong><br>You can change the size of your Container icons at any time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Shortcuts</u></strong><br>The Containers application has shortcuts to help you manipulate your Containers, each shortcut can be modified and disabled.",
    "about_the_game": "<u><strong>Enhance your Windows experience with Containers</strong></u><br><br>Containers allows the storage of your files and folders in boxes called <strong>\u201cContainer\u201d</strong>, these boxes can be accessed at any time on your desktop or called thanks to built-in shortcuts or with the help of the <strong>\u201cContainers Tab\u201d</strong> menu.<br><br><strong><u>Containers</u></strong><br>Containers are sticked to your desktop when you don't use them.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/c9991a7e066b24a3161cd8cf2a674013.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Mirror Containers</u></strong><br>\u201cMirror\u201d Containers are representations of files and folders in a selected folder on your computer.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/684741bb47e6592c577a4f97913da07e.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Container Customization</u></strong><br>Containers can have different colored backgrounds or a background with an image.<br>You can also set the transparency method of your Containers.<br><br>If you are on Windows 11 you can also choose between Containers with rounded or squared edges.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Containers Tab Menu</u></strong><br>The Containers Tab menu allows you to call the Container of your choice without leaving the application in the foreground, it works similarly to the Alt-Tab menu in Windows.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/4e401c4bc6496fa6a7efc7f617df167c.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Closing Containers</u></strong><br>Containers can be independently closed manually or automatically to save space.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/13cf6c9c2cd969444dac2a94756a1424.webp?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Sorting Containers content</u></strong><br>You can independently sort the contents of your Containers according to your choice.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/0b3480c4faaaeced62eb95b8f64e5054.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Container content size</u></strong><br>You can change the size of your Container icons at any time.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1989710/extras/6afeb711456298d139633b60cd69e7aa.avif?t=1678104038\" /></div><br><br><strong><u>Shortcuts</u></strong><br>The Containers application has shortcuts to help you manipulate your Containers, each shortcut can be modified and disabled.",
